name: ['Archangel', 'Ascendant Evincar', 'Avalanche Riders', 'Blue Elemental Blast', 'Bone Shredder', 'Cast Down', "Chandra's Outrage", "Chandra's Spitfire", 'Counterspell', 'Crop Rotation', 'Culling the Weak', 'Cunning Sparkmage', 'Dark Ritual', 'Darksteel Juggernaut', 'Daxos, Blessed by the Sun', 'Diabolic Edict', 'Disenchant', 'Duress', 'Fireball', 'Frantic Search', 'Gingerbrute', 'Goro-Goro, Disciple of Ryusei', 'Harald, King of Skemfar', "Heliod's Pilgrim", 'Hypnotic Sprite // Mesmeric Glare', 'Kuldotha Phoenix', 'Lava Coil', 'Lay Down Arms', 'Lightning Hounds', 'Mental Misstep', 'Parallax Dementia', 'Phantasmal Dragon', 'Phyrexian Rager', "Pyromancer's Gauntlet", "Raiyuu, Storm's Edge", 'Ruin Crab', 'Sandbar Crocodile', "Saryth, the Viper's Fang", 'Scent of Cinder', 'Shield Wall', 'Shivan Dragon', 'Shock', 'Shrieking Drake', 'Silver Drake', 'Sleight of Hand', 'Snuff Out', 'Spined Wurm', 'Sprite Dragon', 'Staggering Insight', 'Stream of Life', 'Talruum Champion', 'Tangled Florahedron // Tangled Vale', 'Thorn Elemental', 'Usher of the Fallen', 'Voltaic Key', 'Warmonger', 'Wild Growth', 'Winged Boots', 'Worn Powerstone', 'Zhalfirin Knight']
