text: ['({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)\\nCounter target spell with mana value 1.', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nAdd {B}{B}{B}{B}.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for a land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Boast — {1}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Human Warrior creature token. (Activate only if this creature attacked this turn and only once each turn.)', "Chandra's Outrage deals 4 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target red spell.\\n• Destroy target red permanent.', 'Counter target spell with mana value 3 or less. (Then exile this card. You may cast the creature later from exile.)', 'Counter target spell.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+2 until end of turn.', "Daxos's toughness is equal to your devotion to white. (Each {W} in the mana costs of permanents you control counts toward your devotion to white.)\\nWhenever another creature you control enters the battlefield or dies, you gain 1 life.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target nonlegendary creature.', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards. Untap up to three lands.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has lifelink and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw a card."', "Enchant creature\\nFading 1 (This enchantment enters the battlefield with one fade counter on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a fade counter from it. If you can't, sacrifice it.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+2.\\nWhen Parallax Dementia leaves the battlefield, destroy enchanted creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}.', 'Equipped creature has flying and ward {4}. (Whenever equipped creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {4}.)\\nEquip {1}', 'Exile target creature with mana value less than or equal to the number of Plains you control. Its controller gains 3 life.', 'First strike', 'First strike\\nWhenever Talruum Champion blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, that creature loses first strike until end of turn.', "First strike\\nWhenever a Samurai or Warrior you control attacks alone, untap it. If it's the first combat phase of the turn, there is an additional combat phase after this phase.", 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{W}{W}: Zhalfirin Knight gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nOther black creatures get +1/+1.\\nNonblack creatures get -1/-1.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying, haste\\nMetalcraft — {4}: Return Kuldotha Phoenix from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your upkeep and only if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Sprite Dragon.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nEcho {2}{B} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Bone Shredder enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature.', 'Flying\\nWhen Phantasmal Dragon becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.', "Flying\\nWhen Shrieking Drake enters the battlefield, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nWhen Silver Drake enters the battlefield, return a white or blue creature you control to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nWhenever an opponent is dealt noncombat damage, Chandra's Spitfire gets +3/+0 until end of turn.", 'Haste\\nEcho {3}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Avalanche Riders enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', "Haste\\n{1}: Gingerbrute can't be blocked this turn except by creatures with haste.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Gingerbrute: You gain 3 life.", 'Haste\\n{T}: Cunning Sparkmage deals 1 damage to any target.', 'If a red instant or sorcery spell you control or a red planeswalker you control would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus 2 to that permanent or player instead.', "If you control a Swamp, you may pay 4 life rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nDestroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Indestructible\\nDarksteel Juggernaut's power and toughness are each equal to the number of artifacts you control.\\nDarksteel Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.", 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each opponent mills three cards. (To mill a card, a player puts the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Lava Coil deals 4 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nWhen Harald, King of Skemfar enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal an Elf, Warrior, or Tyvar card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'Other tapped creatures you control have deathtouch.\\nOther untapped creatures you control have hexproof.\\n{1}, {T}: Untap another target creature or land you control.', "Phasing (This phases in or out before you untap during each of your untap steps. While it's phased out, it's treated as though it doesn't exist.)", 'Reveal any number of red cards in your hand. Scent of Cinder deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Tangled Vale enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player sacrifices a creature.', 'This spell costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nFireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of targets.', "When Heliod's Pilgrim enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Aura card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', "You may have Thorn Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", '{1}, {T}: Untap target artifact.', '{2}: Warmonger deals 1 damage to each creature without flying and each player. Any player may activate this ability.', '{R}: Creatures you control gain haste until end of turn.\\n{3}{R}{R}: Create a 5/5 red Dragon Spirit creature token with flying. Activate only if you control an attacking modified creature. (Equipment, Auras you control, and counters are modifications.)', '{T}: Add {G}.']
flavor: ['"As it moved, the wurm\'s spines gathered up bits of flowstone, which took the shapes of dead villagers\' heads. Each head spoke a single sound, but if taken together, they said, \'Alas for the living.\'"\\n—Dal myth of the wurm', '"Her mind is an incredible mix of emotion and power. Even if I could grasp it, I couldn\'t hold it for long."\\n—Jace Beleren, on Chandra Nalaar', '"I see the weaknesses you hide even from yourself."', '"I\'ve lit most everything on fire—trees, rocks, even the water. Now it\'s time to burn the clouds."', '"Kaervek believes the drakes\' cries herald his victory; in truth, they mourn aloud for his impending demise."\\n—Teferi', '"The tempest is the only ally I need."', '"Things are going to change around here."\\n—Crovax', '"We\'ve run aground sandbars before, but today, a sandbar ran aground us."\\n—Kipkemboi, Kukemssa pirate', '"You returned a warrior. . . . Your hair was cut, your eye tattooed with the red triangle of war."\\n—"Love Song of Night and Day"', 'An inferno is just a gesture away.', 'Funny how money and war travel so well together.', 'Grant limitless flight through the clouds, into battle, and across hardwood floors.', 'It takes no prisoners, but it keeps the choicest bits for Phyrexia.', 'One part unstoppable force, one part immovable object.', 'Quick enough to avoid jhovalls when alone and fierce enough to attack them in packs, the hounds were as at home in the mountains as the Mercadians were atop theirs.', 'Rain from this storm leaves you pinned to the ground like an insect.', "The farmer was amazed to see the penny vanish into thin air, but the goose knew he'd just slipped it to the faerie.", 'The undisputed master of the mountains of Shiv.', '「バーラ・ゲドが再び成長し始めると、自由奔放な驚くべき形の新たな命が花開いた。」\\n――バーラ・ゲドの案内人、ドーラル', '「ファイレクシアは虚空から生まれた。 機械の父、偉大なるヨーグモスはその完成された形を予見なされた。 かくして『偉大なる進化』が始まった。」\\n———ファイレクシア経典', '「司令官、ディミーアのスパイを捕らえ、その遺灰を監禁しました。」\\n――ウォジェクの警備兵、クラム', '「真実から逃げ出すのは臆病者だけ。」\\n――哲人ペリソフィア', '「誰でも死後に思い出してもらえるかは心配なもの。でも心配ないわ、死は名も無き者のものよ。あなたに名前がある限リ、それを堂々と掲げなさい。」\\n――リリアナ', 'どうやらあのラベルのない瓶の中身はバニラエッセンスではなかったようだ。', 'もっとも堅牢な壁とは、石の壁でも鋼の壁でもなく、力を合わせた戦士たちの壁である。', 'スクイーは、同情と安堵が入り交じった気持ちで、カイレンの同類たちが死ぬのを見ていた。', 'タールルームの言葉に、「驚かされる」という言い方はない。', 'パワーストーンの欠片ですら、その中に力だけでなく空間を持つ。脆い水晶の中に閉じ込められた広大な空間だ。', 'ピクシー並みの体、ヘルカイト並みの怒り。', '嘘と霧から生み出されたものにも関わらず、その飢えと怒りは力を持つ。', '探検家にとっては、かけがえのない財宝。カニにとっては、頼れる我が家。', '電光は魂と世界をつなぎ合わせるまのだ。\\n――コーの格言']
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Allen Williams', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Christopher Moeller', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Peterson', 'Erica Yang', 'Filipe Pagliuso', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Hannibal King', 'Heather Hudson', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Ian Miller', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Irina Nordsol', 'Ittoku', 'Jeff Miracola', 'John Bolton', 'Justin Sweet', 'Keith Parkinson', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lawrence Snelly', 'Liiga Smilshkalne', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Micah Epstein', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Jordana', 'Mike Ploog', 'Pat Lewis', 'Pete Venters', 'Randis Albion', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Richard Thomas', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott Kirschner', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Scott Murphy', 'Simon Dominic', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Tom Fleming', 'Una Fricker', 'Vincent Proce', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt & コーヘー', 'rk post']
